WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Faisal: Would you like a hand?

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.100
Hana: I'm fine - just keep the crowd off my left.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.900
Narrator: Faisal asks first.

4
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.700
Narrator: She doesn't want a push.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.500
Narrator: She wants space.

6
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.300
Narrator: So that's what Faisal gives her.

